<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολο-στάτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵστημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weigher of
				obols,</i> i. e. <i>petty usurer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1155
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				168
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.20
			</span></i> ; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν πλουσίων τριάκοντα
				ᾑρέθησαν ὀ., ὅ ἐστι δανεισταὶ ἐπὶ ὀβολῷ τὴν μνᾶν
				δανείζοντες</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.39
			</span></i> : perh. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆσαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δανεῖσαι</span>
			 ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσιμος</span> and <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> s. vv. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολοστάτης,
			ἱστάνειν</span> :—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολο-στάτις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				367b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.112
			</span></i> : hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολο-στᾰτική</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), ἡ, <i>the trade of a
				petty usurer,</i> and generally, <i>usury,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1258b2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
